			"type": "Line",
			"value": " A bracketed head whose body is plainly an expression is a comparison chain only",
			"start": 20,
			"end": 102
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " where tsc reads one. tsc does not guess at a `<`: it parses the type-argument list",
			"start": 104,
			"end": 189
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " for real, with error recovery, and claims the region whenever that recovery still",
			"start": 191,
			"end": 275
		},
		{
			"type": "Line",
			"value": " lands on the `>` — reporting the errors rather than backing off. Each body below is",
			"start": 277,
			"end": 363
		},
